name tkz-berge
category Package
revision 57485
shortdesc Macros for drawing graphs of graph theory
longdesc The package provides a collection of useful macros for drawing
longdesc classic graphs of graph theory, or to make other graphs. This
longdesc package has been taken temporarily out of circulation to give
longdesc the author time to investigate some problems.
